Third-party components

This project depends on third-party open-source software (FastAPI, SQLAlchemy,
Flutter, SimPy and others). Each remains under its own licence; nothing above
alters those terms.

Map data

Maps and routing use OpenStreetMap data, which is © OpenStreetMap contributors
and available under the Open Database Licence (ODbL). ODbL covers that data, not
this source code. Attribution must be shown on every map screen (see ADR-0010).
No OpenStreetMap data is distributed in this repository.
